Commands under `ledgers bills`

Usage: bills <COMMAND>

Commands:
  confirm  bills.confirm
  create   bills.create
  discard  bills.discard
  extract  bills.extract
  get      bills.get
  list     bills.list
  post     bills.post
  update   bills.update
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
